    "creator": "Exalot",
    "date": "2013-11-29",
    "description": "Step into the world of far-away stars and immerse yourself into darkness of cosmic depths on a spaceship with non-technogenic design. Find yourself in distant future and look at the beauty of our own Milky Way with the eyes of a human and aliens' union. Death cannot not stop life in these infinite spaces.\n\n01.Cosmic Voyager (7:52) \n02.Distant Dark (7:56) \n03.Crystal Water and the Sky (7:58) \n04.Lost Hong (13:12) \n05.Death Will Come Too Late (9:04) \n06.Light-Blue Aster (8:08) \n07.Crystal Band (6:22) \n08.Black Steel (9:21) \n09.Tears of Silence (8:54)\n\nComposed by Exalot. All instruments programmed, keyboards and synthesizers played, music written and arranged, 3D modelling and artwork by Mikhail Exalot.\n\n<b>Official Site</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/unitedstudios\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">unitedstudios.ru</a>\n<b>Releases Blog</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-unlimited\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">uscu.unitedstudios.ru</a>\n<b>Last.fm</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-last\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">www.last.fm/label/USC</a>\n<b>Discogs</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-discogs\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">www.discogs.com/label/USC</a>\n<b>Internet Archive</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-archive\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">archive.org/details/usc-label</a>\n<b>Kroogi</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-kroogi\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">usc.kroogi.com</a>\n<b>Bandcamp</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-bandcamp\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">bc.unitedstudios.ru</a>\n<b>VKontakte</b>: <a href=\"http://bit.ly/usc-vk\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">vk.com/unitedstudios</a>",
